# What opens what on SlateOS until a person chooses otherwise (gui/programs,
# design-decisions.md 1425). The freedesktop mimeapps.list format, so the same
# file installs as /usr/share/applications/mimeapps.list. Each line names the
# built-in program whose entry lists the type; gui/programs/INVENTORY.md
# section 4 says where each came from, and which the sources named that are
# not here and why.

[Default Applications]
inode/directory=org.slateos.Explorer.desktop
text/css=org.slateos.Editor.desktop
text/csv=org.slateos.Editor.desktop
text/html=org.slateos.Editor.desktop
text/javascript=org.slateos.Editor.desktop
text/markdown=org.slateos.Editor.desktop
text/plain=org.slateos.Editor.desktop
text/typescript=org.slateos.Editor.desktop
